"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For an earlier Bangkok arrival, investigate the HKG-routing award that arrives first among these shown options; choose the later-arriving HKG alternative only if its shorter elapsed journey and larger reported seat count matter more. The cash search is useful as a separate baseline, not a like-for-like award valuation.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J8@2027-01-15T11:45-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-16T22:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier HKG award\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award via HKG has the earliest arrival of the three shown, and its elapsed journey is 40 minutes shorter than the later HKG option. The tradeoff is a 70-minute HKG award connection and just 1 reported seat. The search returned 65,000 points plus CAD 107.40 in fees; quote scope is unknown, so neither amount is established as per-person or party total.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"TPE award alternative\",\"v\":\"Consider this Aeroplan economy award via TPE if its earlier departure and 9 reported seats are more useful than the HKG option. It arrives 3 hours later than that HKG journey and has a 270-minute TPE award connection. The returned amount is 65,000 points plus CAD 116.50 in fees, with unknown quote scope; points across programs are not being compared here.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J1@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T10:35\",\"n\":\"Later HKG award\",\"v\":\"This Aeroplan economy award via HKG is the shortest elapsed option shown, 2 hours 5 minutes shorter than the TPE alternative, and reports 2 seats. Its downside is the latest arrival among these awards; the HKG award connection is 105 minutes. Its returned amount is 65,000 points plus CAD 107.40 in fees, also with unknown scope.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline\",\"v\":\"The cash search returned USD 440 for a one-stop Singapore Airlines itinerary via SIN, arriving before the shown awards. Its price scope is unknown, so treat it as a benchmark—not a per-person fare, party total, or all-in comparison with award points and fees.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"All three awards are single award itineraries, not nonstop flights; their listed connection times are within the award itinerary, not separate-ticket waits. The cash benchmark also has one stop. The traveler request was for 1, but that does not establish the scope of any quote. These assembled results are not confirmed bookings: availability and current prices require checking with the booking provider. Coverage was partial, and some results may not be real-time.\"}]}"
